  "description": "Upgrade your Toyota 4Runner’s interior with these custom-fit floor mats and trunk mat set, designed specifically for the 2013-2024 5-seater models. Crafted using advanced 3D laser scanning technology, these mats provide a glove-like fit and eliminate pedal interference for a safer, smoother ride. Made from durable, eco-friendly TPE material, these mats offer superior protection against dirt, mud, snow, and spills while maintaining a stylish look. The unique backrest and trunk mat, inspired by the vehicle’s original aesthetics, ensures seamless integration with your 4Runner’s interior while keeping it clean and looking great.\nFeatures\nBuilt to Last: OEDRO floor mats are made from durable, high-quality rubber, offering superior longevity compared to other mats. The flexible, heavy-duty material resists wear and tear, even under constant use and friction from shoes.\nStylish & Classy Look: Upgrade your car’s interior with OEDRO all-weather floor mats. Their sleek, modern design enhances the look of your vehicle, adding a touch of color and sophistication that blends seamlessly with any interior.\nComprehensive Interior Protection: Protect your car’s interior with OEDRO floor mats, designed to keep your carpet clean and dry. These mats provide full coverage, preventing dirt, spills, and moisture from damaging your vehicle’s flooring.\nEasy to Clean & Maintain: Cleaning OEDRO mats is a breeze. Simply wipe away spills or rinse with soap and water. Once dry, there’s no lingering odor, leaving your car fresh and spotless.\nTraps Dirt & Moisture: OEDRO’s waterproof floor mats effectively trap dirt, dust, sand, and spills, keeping your car’s interior clean and dry. The deep channels and durable surface keep moisture and debris from spreading, ensuring your car stays pristine.\n2 years warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with Toyota 4Runner 2013-2024 (5-Passenger Models ONLY).",
  "highlights": [
    "All-weather protection system with deep channels and raised edges that trap mud, snow, and spills, keeping your floor clean, dry, and fully protected year-round.",
    "Made from eco-friendly TPE material that is odorless, durable, and flexible, offering long-lasting performance while remaining safe for family use and extreme temperatures.",
    "Waterproof surface allows quick rinse or wipe cleaning, while anti-slip texture and secure fit system keep mats stable and firmly in place during daily driving."
  ],
